  m_text: Aww... Little Jackson here is a one year old Jack Russell Terrier. He came
    all the way with me from the old house. Oh, the good times. He LOVES his old
    smelly wooden crate. Look at how soundly he sleeps! I envy him. Lucky fella!
    You never have to get up and go to work...
